        "type": "paragraph",
        "answer": "The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard introduced by Anthropic in November 2024 to function like a \"USB-C port\" for artificial intelligence. It standardizes how AI applications (like Claude or ChatGPT) connect to external data sources, tools, and enterprise systems.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "header",
        "answer": "How It Works"
      },
      {
        "type": "unordered_list",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "answer": "MCP Hosts (Clients): The AI applications or IDEs (such as Claude Desktop, VS Code, or Cursor) that initiate connections and orchestrate workflows.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              2
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "answer": "MCP Servers: Lightweight programs that expose specific capabilities, data, or tools (like Google Drive, GitHub, Slack, Postgres, or local files) via JSON-RPC 2.0.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              2
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "answer": "Bidirectional Communication: Unlike static Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) which only reads passive information, MCP allows AI models to actively query data, execute tools, and perform live actions across systems"
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          2,
          3
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "header",
        "answer": "Key Benefits"
      },
      {
        "type": "unordered_list",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "answer": "Universal Standard: Replaces fragmented, custom-built code integrations for every single API or database with a single plug-and-play protocol.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              6
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "answer": "Ecosystem Growth: In December 2025, Anthropic donated MCP to the Agentic AI Foundation under the Linux Foundation. Official SDKs and reference servers are maintained across Python, TypeScript, Java, C#, and other languages on GitHub.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "answer": "Security & Control: Built with explicit user consent requirements, local environment support, and sandboxed tool execution.",
